    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 100 unique puzzles to solve<br></li><li>Stunning anime artwork<br></li><li>Radio system with 10 musical tracks<br></li><li>PC exclusive<br></li><li>Relaxing and immersive gameplay<br></li><li>Meticulous attention to detail in puzzle design<br></li><li>Perfect for anime and puzzle lovers alike.</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>If you're a fan of anime and love puzzles, then our casual jigsaw game is the perfect way to indulge in both of these passions. With over 100 unique puzzles and stunning anime artwork, this game offers hours of relaxing entertainment.<br><br>Each puzzle is designed with meticulous attention to detail, ensuring that every piece fits perfectly. The custom-created radio system features 10 unique tracks, so you can enjoy your favorite music while piecing together the puzzles.<br><br>Our PC exclusive game is perfect for those who want to relax and unwind. The game offers a soothing and immersive experience, allowing you to escape into a world of cute anime girls and beautiful artwork.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you beat the ultimate challenge?!</h2><br>Are you up for the ultimate challenge in Boobsle? The final puzzle is a true test of your skills, with the difficulty ramped up to the max. But fear not, for the reward is worth the effort!<br><br>Completing the final puzzle is a true accomplishment, one that will fill you with pride and satisfaction. It's the perfect way to cap off your journey through the game's 100+ puzzles, and a true testament to your puzzle-solving prowess.",
    "about_the_game": "If you're a fan of anime and love puzzles, then our casual jigsaw game is the perfect way to indulge in both of these passions. With over 100 unique puzzles and stunning anime artwork, this game offers hours of relaxing entertainment.<br><br>Each puzzle is designed with meticulous attention to detail, ensuring that every piece fits perfectly. The custom-created radio system features 10 unique tracks, so you can enjoy your favorite music while piecing together the puzzles.<br><br>Our PC exclusive game is perfect for those who want to relax and unwind. The game offers a soothing and immersive experience, allowing you to escape into a world of cute anime girls and beautiful artwork.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you beat the ultimate challenge?!</h2><br>Are you up for the ultimate challenge in Boobsle? The final puzzle is a true test of your skills, with the difficulty ramped up to the max. But fear not, for the reward is worth the effort!<br><br>Completing the final puzzle is a true accomplishment, one that will fill you with pride and satisfaction. It's the perfect way to cap off your journey through the game's 100+ puzzles, and a true testament to your puzzle-solving prowess.",
    "short_description": "Embark on a captivating journey with Boobsle! Solve stunning anime puzzles, meet charming characters, and immerse in breathtaking art. Experience the beauty as you unlock secrets within each puzzle. Delight in gorgeous art and captivating characters. Get ready for an unforgettable adventure!",
